      "prompt_hash": "e77ffad9dd5dd264",
      "draft": "Nicco holds the boots out toward Blackthorn.\n\nShe looks at the boots, then up at him, her expression shifting from mild surprise to something closer to mild irritation — the kind reserved for time-wasting. She doesn't reach for them. \"Keep them,\" she said flatly. \"They're a gift, not a loan. I don't take back what I give, and I don't carry things for people who just handed them.\" Her tone left little room. She glanced at the two large men flanking her, then back to Nicco. \"You're standing in front of your own tower in your feet. Put them on, throw them in a corner, sell them — I don't care. But they're yours.\"\n\nOne of the bodyguards shifted his weight slightly but said nothing. Blackthorn's attention was already moving past the boots, back toward the square and whatever had brought her here.",
